    "html": "<p>A current-carrying wire is in a uniform magnetic field. The arrow shows the direction in which negative charge flows. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the direction of the electromagnetic force that acts on the wire?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">Out of the page</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">Into the page</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">To the left</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">To the right</li>\n</ol>"
